  "sampleSentence": "Marble River Provincial Park is a provincial park in British Columbia, Canada.",
  "fullTextRaw": "Marble River Provincial Park is a provincial park in British Columbia, Canada. The park is located on northern Vancouver Island. It is 14.19 km2 (5.48 sq mi) in area. The park protects an eagle nesting habitat near Quatsino Narrows in Quatsino Sound, a steelhead fishery, and an extensive waterfowl habitat.  A 4.2 km (2.6 mi)-long biking or walking trail is available, as well as opportunities for wildlife viewing.\n\n50°32′30″N 127°31′35″W﻿ / ﻿50.5417°N 127.5264°W﻿ / 50.5417; -127.5264",
